But canvas pointerdown events bubble. Fine.

Also potential double-trigger when clicking strikeBtn? That's outside scene.

Second issue: outfit cost requires iron (10 Iron), which player doesn't have early. Starting caps 25 and outfit costs 80 caps + 10 iron, meaning outfits inaccessible until iron mining. That's okay as progression.

Third: the 404s are favicon. Add a favicon link (inline data URI) to eliminate. Good polish.

Fourth: audio warnings repeated; check audio.js. Likely creates a new AudioContext every tone and Chrome complains until gesture. Let's inspect.

